From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 06:57:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Skip non-rendered elements and fast-path ASCII in codepoint
 indexing

Skip script, style, title, and noscript text nodes when updating the document codepoint bitset and non-Latin write probe, and use a single-pass ASCII byte loop for codepoint bits.
---
 src/document.rs | 105 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/mutator.rs  |  28 ++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 121 insertions(+), 12 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/document.rs b/src/document.rs
